  "bankVersion": 1,
  "comment": "Taste quiz question bank. Each side is a declarative selector over the venue corpus: `categories` restricts by venue category; `where` predicates are [field, op, percentile] with op ltp/gtp = below/above that corpus percentile of the named fingerprint field. build_taste_space.py resolves each side to an exemplar venue set and derives the question's taste-space axis as the normalized difference of side centroids. Exactly one anchor question per taste dimension; anchors double as the interpretive axes that back the 5-dim radar/copy view.",
